{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_93_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_93","textTraditional":"一、三十年，春王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_93_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_93","textTraditional":"二、夏，狄侵齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_93_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_93","textTraditional":"三、秋，衞殺其大夫元咺及公子瑕。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_93_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_93","textTraditional":"衞侯未至，其稱國以殺何？道殺也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_93_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_93","textTraditional":"四、衞侯鄭歸于衞。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_93_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_93","textTraditional":"此殺其大夫，其言歸何？歸惡乎元咺也。曷為歸惡乎元咺？元咺之事君也，君出則己入，君入則己出，以為不臣也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_93_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_93","textTraditional":"五、晉人、秦人圍鄭。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_93_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_93","textTraditional":"六、介人侵蕭。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_93_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_93","textTraditional":"七、冬，天王使宰周公來聘。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_93_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_93","textTraditional":"八、公子遂如京師，遂如晉。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_93_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_93","textTraditional":"大夫無遂事，此其言遂何？公不得為政爾。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}